"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_27","text":"I got too greedy and something we were working on went wrong. As a result, the people I was working with suffered greatly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_28","text":"I pushed myself then in hopes of having a better life, but it didn't pan out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_29","text":"All I succeeded in doing was angering those around me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_30","text":"It was all my fault. That much is true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_31","text":"I ruined everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_33","text":"Ever since then, whenever someone tells me I did something wrong...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_34","text":"I have a panic attack.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_35","text":"Yikes. Now I'm scared of criticizing you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_36","text":"I'm not always like this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_37","text":"It's only when I'm trying to hide something and get caught doing it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_38","text":"When that happens, it triggers something in me, and I have difficulty breathing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_39","text":"So... that means you really don't know the way?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_40","text":"... Yes. I'm sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_41","text":"I thought it would work out somehow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_42","text":"I didn't expect the crystals to be so manifold and in random places like they are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_43","text":"So no... I don't know the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_46","text":"I'm completely at a loss.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_47","text":"I don't know where we're going, how to get there, or even if we're going in the right direction. Nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_48","text":"Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_49","text":"Our guide doesn't know the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_50","text":"What would you like to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_51","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_52","text":"I think the reason we're in this situation","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_53","text":"is because we were too cautious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_54","text":"... Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_55","text":"Isn't being cautious a good thing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_56","text":"We're in unknown territory, so it's natural to be on guard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_57","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_57","text":"In fact, I think we were walking on eggshells nearly every step of the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_58","text":"We treated anything and everything around us with suspicion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_59","text":"In other words, we only wore ourselves out doing so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_60","text":"Yes. Beyond what's necessary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_61","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_61","text":"So let's relax a bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_62","text":"And how do we achieve that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_63","text":"Nothing has changed: one misstep, and we're all toast.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_64","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_64","text":"We loosen up and do things our way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_65","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_65","text":"We all know the inherent danger of what we're doing, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_66","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_66","text":"So long as we avoid those, we've got leeway to do what we want.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_67","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_67","text":"In a way, this is a treasure hunt. We have the right to be a little excited.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_68","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_69","text":"I think you're onto something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_70","text":"Honestly, I wasn't a big fan of everyone being on tenterhooks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_71","text":"I'll stick close to you, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_72","text":"We'll be fine so long as our heads remain intact, but the same cannot be said for you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_73","text":"I'm still not convinced that everything's gonna be hunky-dory if we're a bunch of severed heads...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_74","text":"What should I do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_75","text":"I was meant to be a guide, but I don't know the way...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_76","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_76","text":"You said you never forget the way from which you've come, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_77","text":"Yes. That I'm confident with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_78","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_78","text":"Then you can help us retrace our steps if things get hairy later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_79","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_79","text":"That's the most important part and it's a task we'll entrust to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_80","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_81","text":"I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_04_s_82","text":"Thank you, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_mai